\paragraph{No signal reliably surpasses greedy.}
On NER, the oracle (0.776) reveals 13.2~pp of headroom above greedy (0.644).
Logprob achieves the highest selection F1 (0.650, +0.6~pp), but this is not statistically significant ($p{=}0.39$, 3-seed bootstrap; Cohen's $d{=}0.038$).

